{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattpilott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-09-29T11:07:49Z","updated_at":"2018-09-29T11:07:49Z","body":"Following on from our discord chat i thought id add the something here with a link to my project https://github.com/matt3224/blog in-case that helps at all","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rollup/rollup/issues/comments/425636837/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"mattpilott","id":2401925,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MDE5MjU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2401925?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattpilott","html_url":"https://github.com/mattpilott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattpilott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattpilott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattpilott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattpilott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattpilott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattpilott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattpilott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattpilott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattpilott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rollup/rollup/issues/comments/425655543","html_url":"https://github.com/rollup/rollup/issues/2461#issuecomment-425655543","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rollup/rollup/issues/2461","id":425655543,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQyNTY1NTU0Mw==","user":{"login":"Rich-Harris","id":1162160,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjIxNjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1162160?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris","html_url":"https://github.com/Rich-Harris","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-09-29T15:59:00Z","updated_at":"2018-09-29T15:59:00Z","body":"I've whittled the bug down to its essence: https://github.com/Rich-Harris/rollup-repro-2461\r\n\r\nIt looks like what's happening is that a chunk is registering another chunk as an import *before* the imported chunk has been given a name. Given modules like this...\r\n\r\n```js\r\n// main.js\r\nexport default [\r\n  () => import('./a.js'),\r\n  () => import('./b.js')\r\n];\r\n\r\n// a.js\r\nimport './d.js'\r\nimport c from './c.js';\r\n\r\nexport default () => c();\r\n\r\n// b.js\r\nimport c from './c.js';\r\n\r\nexport default () => c();\r\n\r\n// c.js\r\nexport default () => console.log('c');\r\n\r\n// d.js\r\nexport default {};\r\n```\r\n\r\n...we'd expect to have four chunks — one for the `main.js` entry point, one for each of the dynamic import entry points (`a.js` and `b.js`), and one for the shared dependency (`c.js`) — and we'd expect the `a.js` and `b.js` chunks to list the fourth chunk as an import:\r\n\r\n```js\r\n[\r\n  {\r\n    fileName: 'main.js',\r\n    imports: [],\r\n    modules: ['main.js']\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    fileName: 'a.js',\r\n    imports: ['chunk.js'],\r\n    modules: ['d.js', 'a.js']\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    fileName: 'chunk.js',\r\n    imports: [],\r\n    modules: ['c.js']\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    fileName: 'b.js',\r\n    imports: ['chunk.js'],\r\n    modules: ['b.js']\r\n  }\r\n]\r\n```\r\n\r\nWe *do* end up with the four correct chunks, but the `a.js` chunk's import is `undefined`:\r\n\r\n```diff\r\n[\r\n  {\r\n    fileName: 'main.js',\r\n    imports: [],\r\n    modules: ['main.js']\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    fileName: 'a.js',\r\n-    imports: ['chunk.js'],\r\n+    imports: [undefined],\r\n    modules: ['d.js', 'a.js']\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    fileName: 'chunk.js',\r\n    imports: [],\r\n    modules: ['c.js']\r\n  },\r\n  {\r\n    fileName: 'b.js',\r\n    imports: ['chunk.js'],\r\n    modules: ['b.js']\r\n  }\r\n]\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rollup/rollup/issues/comments/425655543/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"Rich-Harris","id":1162160,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjIxNjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1162160?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris","html_url":"https://github.com/Rich-Harris","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rich-Harris/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.git